			{
				"id": 29964,
				"title": "Overview",
				"body_text": "Shurrai showers players with [Briny Vomit] before washing away both players and vomit with [Dark Tide].\r\n\r\nAt 100 energy Shurrai casts [Regurgitate Souls], summoning Drowned Arathi and shielding himself with [Shroud of the Drowned].",
				"sections": [
					{
						"id": 29965,
						"title": "Tanks",
						"body_text": "$bullet;[Abyssal Strike] applies a heal absorb equivalent to the amount of damage inflicted.\r\n$bullet;[Dark Tide] washes away pools of [Briny Vomit].\r\n$bullet;Drowned Arathi inflict a significant amount of damage to Shurrai when slain."
					},
					{
						"id": 29966,
						"title": "Healers",
						"body_text": "$bullet;Drowned Arathi inflict [Ocean's Reckoning] upon death.\r\n$bullet;[Dark Tide] washes away pools of [Briny Vomit].\r\n$bullet;Drowned Arathi inflict a significant amount of damage to Shurrai when slain."
					},
